From 769f924a48305bcf2581485655569250e4b0b64d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 04:23:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(instruments): measure in layout space, fix CSS-modules
 build error, add depth

- Build: the host rule was an attribute-only selector, which CSS modules
  reject; name the two local classes instead (checked with lightningcss pure).
- Alignment: the controller is scroll-tilted by GSAP, so screen-rect
  measurement mid-tilt put every part where its control had been. Measure from
  offsetLeft/Top (layout space) plus static translations, and re-measure when
  parts resize or fonts land.
- Depth: contact shadows, a near point light that follows the pointer, recessed
  bank plates, a dark keywell and a raised brand plate; hide the DOM copies of
  those surfaces.
